            "sid": "JER 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, meji hiyakunana kukabeta kakuchi muniswa akabalumuka hikaloŋa kadibaji, akasumpokela mwituŋa, nihyumayejima yidumu, nihamukala, nihadi antu ashakamamu. Antu akayiba, antu ejima ashakama mwituŋa kakaloka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakutiya lushindu lwayikwa yawayindi akwaŋovu akudatola heseki, hakutiya lushindu lwamakálu indi, nichi kuvu matufumbu twindi, atata jawantu hiyamweni nŋakutala hanyima nawuatali anyanawu nehi, muŋa mumakasawu munazeyi dehi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋawefuku dakuyipupa aFwilistinu ejima didi nakwinza, dakuyifumisha aTira naZidoni ankwashi ejima anashaluku. Muloŋa Yehova wakayipupa aFwilistinu, wowu antu aha chitutu chaKafwatori anashaluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibalada muwana dehi Gaza; Ashekeloni wela dehi wamukunkulwayi, chochine kineki chawu chinashaluku. Wakadi tapolaŋa kushika nikumwakanyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.47.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
